---
import SiteLayout from "@/layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="About" description="Augur project, foundation, and contact information.">
  <main class="scaffold">
    <p class="scaffold__status">Implementation scaffold · not production copy</p>
    <h1>About Augur</h1>
    <p class="scaffold__question">Who is behind the work, and how can I reach them?</p>
    <section id="foundation">
      <h2>Lituus Foundation</h2>
      <p>The foundation’s funding and development-support role is described in the website strategy. Its precise operator attribution and public details require maintainer review.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="contact">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>A general inquiry destination has not yet been verified for this rebuild. This section will provide a direct contact route after review.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
